#  This script provides a modular implementation of the simulation
#  study for the gene-level high-dimensional mediation analysis.
#  It contains:
#    1. Data generation function:        gen_sim_data()
#    2. Wilks' Lambda test function:     wilks_lambda_test()
#    3. Cauchy p-value combination:       cauchy_combine()
